#: includes/admin/views/edit.php:196 includes/admin/views/edit.php:198
msgid "Token"
msgstr "Token"

#: includes/admin/views/edit.php:199 includes/admin/views/edit.php:266
msgid "Generate"
msgstr "Generar"

#: includes/admin/views/edit.php:202
msgid "You create the token and give it to the sender together with the URL; their system must send it in this header on every call. With the Authorization header, \"Bearer <token>\" is accepted too."
msgstr "Tú creas el token y se lo das al remitente junto con la URL; su sistema debe enviarlo en esta cabecera en cada llamada. Con la cabecera Authorization también se acepta «Bearer <token>»."

#: includes/admin/views/edit.php:210
msgid "Only accept calls from these IP addresses"
msgstr "Aceptar llamadas solo desde estas direcciones IP"

#: includes/admin/views/edit.php:213
msgid "Allowed IP addresses"
msgstr "Direcciones IP permitidas"

#: includes/admin/views/edit.php:215
